Description:It is your first main phase. You control Chandra, Torch of Defiance with 4 loyalty (+1: exile the top card of your library; you may cast it; if you don't, 2 damage to each opponent). Your library is all Colossal Dreadmaws and you have no mana. The opponent is at 2 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-loyalty-plus-damage | A loyalty ability's cost is adding or removing loyalty, activated once per turn at sorcery speed (CR 606.3-4): +1 exiles a Dreadmaw you can't cast, so Chandra deals 2 to each opponent
